 COPY DRAGSTATE.
 01 WS-NEED                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-NOCOLLIDE           BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-PHASE               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-H                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-YO                  FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-D2                  FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-SEES                BINARY-LONG.
